github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T22:42:37Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T22:42:37Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4607573771/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4612226060","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119977#issuecomment-4612226060","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119977","id":4612226060,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEuj8DA","user":{"login":"novalis","id":77003,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDAz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77003?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis","html_url":"https://github.com/novalis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novalis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T12:19:39Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T12:19:39Z","body":"\n\nOn June 2, 2026 12:13:37 PM EDT, Lukas Tenbrink ***@***.***> wrote:\n>@Ivorforce approved this pull request.\n>\n>Makes sense to me.\n>While errors in the driver are definitely worth fixing fully, spamming the console with redundant info doesn't help anyone.\n>\n>> @@ -506,7 +507,11 @@ void AudioDriverPulseAudio::thread_func(void *p_udata) {\n> \n> \t\t\t\t\tpa_operation_unref(pa_op);\n> \t\t\t\t} else {\n>-\t\t\t\t\tERR_PRINT(\"pa_context_get_server_info error: \" + String(pa_strerror(pa_context_errno(ad->pa_ctx))));\n>+\t\t\t\t\tint pa_errno = pa_context_errno(ad->pa_ctx);\n>+\t\t\t\t\tif (pa_errno != last_reported_errno) {\n>+\t\t\t\t\t\tlast_reported_errno = pa_errno;\n>+\t\t\t\t\t\tERR_PRINT(\"pa_context_get_server_info error: \" + String(pa_strerror(pa_errno)));\n>\n>Should probably mention that future errors of the same kind will be suppressed.\n>\n\nLooks like this PR got merged before I got to this.  I think that's OK -- the error message is an internal Godot thing, and the audio server is entirely in control of whether to keep trying `pa_context_get_server_info` on a dead connection (and how often to do so). \n\nSince we never reconnect, future (now elided) messages of this sort are inevitable and meaningless. When we find someone to review the reconnect code and get that merged, then it could be interesting to learn that we are continuing to fail to reconnect, and thus interesting that we are eliding those notices; at that point I could add a notice, or exponential backoff or something if desired.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4612226060/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]